        //     interactive commit (label / legend drag, slider nudge) funnels
        //     through the 1500 ms _setOption debounce, so at undo time the new
        //     value is usually still queued (un-flushed) or held awaiting R's
        //     echo. render()'s entry re-applies BOTH layers over R's data, and
        //     a live flush timer re-sends the pending value to R - so the
        //     chart snaps back a beat after the undo ("undo, then it pops
        //     back to the new position"). Drop each restored key from pending
        //     and pin recentCommits to the snapshot value (which self-clears
        //     once R echoes a match, guarding the echo window meanwhile).
